        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jem Finer, James McNally, Tom McManamon\n- Organizations: The Pogues, Storm\n- Products: \"Peace and Love\", \"Misty Morning, Albert Bridge\", Longplayer\n\nFacts:\n- Jem Finer was one of the founding members of The Pogues.\n- Jem Finer composed \"Misty Morning, Albert Bridge,\" and the song appeared on The Pogues' fourth album, \"Peace and Love.\"\n- Jem Finer created Longplayer, a self-extending composition designed to continue for one thousand years.\n- James McNally was previously a member of The Pogues and of Storm, a group with Tom McManamon.",
